zj/thumb/a/a2/4c3291ly8asa0ao65z16up2to80c723.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E7%AA%92%E6%81%AF%E5%AF%92%E6%A3%98.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/a/a2/4c3291ly8asa0ao65z16up2to80c723.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E7%AA%92%E6%81%AF%E5%AF%92%E6%A3%98.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/a/a2/4c3291ly8asa0ao65z16up2to80c723.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />窒息寒棘\n</th>\n<td class=\"text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;消耗：</b>/\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;技能类别：</b>职业技能\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;冷却：</b>/\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;攻击方式：</b>范围攻击、对地面\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程：</b>0-4\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程高低差：</b>↓5-↑3\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围：</b>1\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围高低差：</b>↓2-↑2\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:70%;\" colspan=\"3\">\n<p>（穿透伤害）对目标范围<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>格内所有敌人，造成<font color=\"#d68fe2\">50%</font>魔攻值的[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"穿透伤害\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">穿透伤害</font></span></span>]，对主目标敌人额外施加[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"锁链\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">锁链</font></span></span>]。<br /> ✦[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"附属被动\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">附属被动</font></span></span>]，效果：<br />行动结束时，偷取[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"锁链\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">锁链</font></span></span>]拥有者及其范围<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>格内所有敌人<font color=\"#58cb48\">1</font>点能量、<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>个[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">增益</span>]，并施加<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>层[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"极寒\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">极寒</font></span></span>]、随机<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>个[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"2级减益\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">2级减益</font></span></span>]（持续2回合）。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:10%;\"><img alt=\"技能范围 0-4 1.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/6/6e/hm12z689zrnh3tgaa74diysu98g71mk.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_0-4_1.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"82\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/6/6e/hm12z689zrnh3tgaa74diysu98g71mk.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"97\" data-file-height=\"99\" />\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">可习得该技能的角色\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门外</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:70px;height:70px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E5%A1%9E%E5%A8%9C\" title=\"角色图鉴库/塞娜\"><img alt=\"头像 塞娜.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/2/2c/gk5xl4lk65d1ejg085shrrggybf1da0.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" class=\"img-kk\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file